@startuml
title FR-08 - Search Donor Profiles - Activity Diagram

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond

|Receptionist|
start
:Open the donor search;

|Client|
:Display the search criteria fields;

|Receptionist|
:Enter available search criteria;
:Click the search button;

|Server — Donors|
:Validate the search criteria;

if (Search criteria invalid?) then ([Yes])
  |Client|
  :Explain the problem with the criteria;
  stop
else ([No])
endif

|Server — Donors|
:Retrieve matching donor profiles\nwithin the permitted scope;

if (Retrieval failed?) then ([Yes])
  |Client|
  :Explain the retrieval problem;
  stop
else ([No])
endif

|Server — Donors|
if (No matching profiles?) then ([Yes])
  |Client|
  :Display that no matching profiles were found;

  |Receptionist|
  if (Proceed to FR-09?) then ([Yes])
    |Client|
    :Open donor profile registration (FR-09);
    stop
  else ([No])
    |Receptionist|
    stop
  endif

else ([No])
  |Client|
  :Display the matching profiles;

  |Receptionist|
  :Check the donor's identity;

  if (Multiple matching profiles?) then ([Yes])
    :Compare matching profiles\nusing available information;
  else ([No])
  endif

  :Identify the correct profile;
  stop
endif

@enduml